# Production build defaults — checked-in on purpose.
# In production (korehealths.com) the Next.js static export is served by Django,
# so the API is on the same origin and a relative `/api` baseURL is correct.
# Any host-specific override (e.g. host-only network IP for dev) should live in
# `.env.local`, which Next.js prioritizes only when present locally.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=/api
